## Firebase Android push (google-services.json)
# Single Firebase project with all Android apps in one file:
#   credentials/firebase/google-services.json
#   - com.grimm.labs.app              (production)
#   - com.grimm.labs.app.development
#   - com.grimm.labs.app.staging
# Gradle picks the correct client entry from applicationId at build time (APP_ENV).
# Copy credentials/firebase/google-services.example.json or download from Firebase Console.
#
# CI: one GitHub secret for all environments:
#   GOOGLE_SERVICES_JSON
# Encode locally: base64 -i credentials/firebase/google-services.json | pbcopy
#
# FCM V1 Service Account (for sending push via Expo) stays in Expo Credentials — not in this repo.

